# What the data pipeline imports, pinned to the versions it is developed and
# tested against (the project venv). The weekly refresh installs from the
# hashed lock compiled from this, pipeline/requirements.txt — never from an
# unpinned `pip install`, because that job publishes the site's data.
#
# To change a version: edit it here, then regenerate the lock with
#   uv pip compile pipeline/requirements.in --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 \
#     -o pipeline/requirements.txt
